\newlabel{tab:smoke}{{2}{3}{E05 measurement cohorts, including drain commits. W/R denotes workers/repetition. Window counts commits before cutoff; handoffs are mid-Q2. These are functional smoke counts, not native throughput comparisons.\relax }{table.caption.4}{}}
